{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\n  \"feel\": \"一开始有一种突然被触动的郑重和热切，随后渐渐转为温柔的向往，带着一点惆怅。并不悲伤，也没有真正安心，像是心里已经有了期待，却还不知道它能不能得到满足。\",\n  \"thread\": \"有些美好的东西，还没真正得到，就已经让人深深在意。最初那份热切里有真实的喜悦，因为仅仅感到它值得向往，就已经让人高兴。可这份喜悦还没有什么可以依靠：被打动是一回事，能不能真正得到又是另一回事。所以热切渐渐收住以后，在意并没有消失，反而留下了一点舍不得、又暂时无从安顿的心情。\",\n  \"used\": \"无\",\n  \"new\": [\n    \"有一种美好的可能已经使人真切地感到喜悦和向往，但它还没有成为可以安心依靠的满足。\",\n    \"最初的热切过去以后，这份在意依然存在，同时带着一点尚未得到的惆怅。\"\n  ],\n  \"unexplained\": \"无\"\n}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "1fda0f2c-37c2-4589-ab13-285e2c5c8974", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261023T223817601729Z", "elapsed_seconds": 96.953, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T22:39:54.568433+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "003a15b91c5531501419d7336f1a876bf7024b03ca3f56b58fd9323e0bcffedf", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a73707